  "label": "social media users familiar with face-swapping apps",
  "description": "The meme targets individuals who are active on social media platforms and are familiar with digital photo editing tools like FaceApp. The reference to 'this faceapp stuff' and the expression of amazement ('is incredible!') are tailored to an audience that appreciates and engages with viral digital trends, particularly those involving AI-powered face-swapping technology. The lighthearted, playful context (a child reacting to a digitally altered stuffed animal) is designed to resonate with users who enjoy sharing and celebrating creative, humorous, or impressive digital manipulations online.",
